		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=15875#p15875"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Ceci fonctionne pour moi :</p><p>postgres=# select &#039;a&#039;||E&#039;\\000&#039;::bytea||&#039;b&#039;;<br /> ?column? <br />----------<br /> a\000b<br />(1 row)</p><p>postgres=# select pg_typeof(&#039;a&#039;||E&#039;\\000&#039;::bytea||&#039;b&#039;);<br /> pg_typeof <br />-----------<br /> bytea<br />(1 row)</p><p>postgres=# select length(&#039;a&#039;||E&#039;\\000&#039;::bytea||&#039;b&#039;);<br /> length <br />--------<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; 3<br />(1 row)</p><p>(testé sur une 9.2)</p>]]></content>
